# Only the Unity project itself is kept: Assets, Packages, ProjectSettings (+ this file and the README).
# Everything Unity regenerates (Library, Temp, Logs, UserSettings, *.csproj, *.slnx) and the local work folders
# (Builds, BlenderWork, docs, work) stay out.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/Assets/
!/Packages/
!/ProjectSettings/

# test-runner leftovers and OS junk
/Assets/InitTestScene*.unity
/Assets/InitTestScene*.unity.meta
*.pidb.meta
*.pdb.meta
*.mdb.meta
.DS_Store

# tool state that ends up inside Assets (hidden folders; Unity ignores them anyway)
.omc/
